  "description": "Streamed structure tiles for SailSimUE \u2014 OSM houses (gable/cape/brick), hero landmarks, ENC lights/pilings, trees, grass tufts, hydrangeas. NAVT meshes from sail-sim bake. Load only near the boat. Optional staticMesh/staticMeshLod1 from cook_nantucket_structures_nanite.py.",
